    Array(0.+30.j, dtype=complex64)

    For multi-dimensional inputs, batch dimensions are stacked rather than broadcast:

    >>> a = jnp.ones((2, 3))
    >>> b = jnp.ones((5, 3))
    >>> jnp.inner(a, b).shape
    (2, 5)

